  "name": {
   "zh": "动作生成 · Sketch2Anim 画线",
   "en": "Motion Generation · Sketch2Anim Sketch"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Sketch2Anim 把分镜草图变成三维动画：三维关键姿势、关节轨迹和动作词控制的生成器，加一层把草图对到同一空间的映射。这张卡在空画布上画火柴人，默认重定目标到「标准人」（SMPL-X，需注册）交付蒙皮角色 USD；不想注册就在「目标角色」选「原骨架」。整张卡仅限研究（权重用 AMASS 训练）。",
   "en": "Sketch2Anim turns storyboard sketches into 3D animation with a generator controlled by 3D key poses, joint trajectories and action words. This card draws stick figures on an empty canvas and by default retargets to Standard Human (SMPL-X, registration required), delivering a skinned character USD; to skip registration choose Original Skeleton in Target Character. Research only (weights trained on AMASS)."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-20T13:00:00",
  "deliverable": "motion_gen",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
